  'The profile is self-reported; this is not a hiring probability. Experience, education, interests, proficiency and salary are not scored.': ['The profile is self-reported; this is not a hiring probability. Experience, education, interests, proficiency and salary are not scored.', 'Profil ini dilaporkan sendiri; hasil ini bukan kebarangkalian untuk diambil bekerja. Pengalaman, pendidikan, minat, tahap kemahiran dan gaji tidak diberi skor.', '个人档案由用户自行填写；结果不是录用概率。经验、教育、兴趣、熟练程度及薪资均不计分。'],
  'The requirements comparison could not be completed. Your browser profile was not changed.': ['The requirements comparison could not be completed. Your browser profile was not changed.', 'Perbandingan keperluan tidak dapat diselesaikan. Profil pelayar anda tidak diubah.', '无法完成要求比较。您的浏览器个人档案未被更改。'],
  'The source returned no valid monthly observations.': ['The source returned no valid monthly observations.', 'Sumber tidak memulangkan pemerhatian bulanan yang sah.', '来源未返回有效的月度观测值。'],
  'The workbook snapshot could not be loaded.': ['The workbook snapshot could not be loaded.', 'Petikan buku kerja tidak dapat dimuatkan.', '无法加载工作簿快照。'],
  'These 50 existing records describe only this dataset. Category and skill counts are not live vacancies or measures of market demand.': ['These 50 existing records describe only this dataset. Category and skill counts are not live vacancies or measures of market demand.', '50 rekod sedia ada ini hanya menerangkan set data ini. Kiraan kategori dan kemahiran bukan kekosongan semasa atau ukuran permintaan pasaran.', '这 50 条现有记录仅描述此数据集。类别和技能计数不代表当前职位空缺或市场需求。'],
  'These are hypothetical planning cases, not validated predictions.': ['These are hypothetical planning cases, not validated predictions.', 'Ini kes perancangan hipotetikal, bukan ramalan yang disahkan.', '这些是规划假设情景，并非经过验证的预测。'],
  'This is a requirements comparison, not a skill-fit score or hiring prediction.': ['This is a requirements comparison, not a skill-fit score or hiring prediction.', 'Ini perbandingan keperluan, bukan skor padanan kemahiran atau ramalan pengambilan pekerja.', '这是职位要求比较，不是技能匹配评分或录用预测。'],
  'This is a {status} profile with {count} required {answerLabel} still missing ({fields}). Matching works with your skills, but': ['This is a {status} profile with {count} required {answerLabel} still missing ({fields}). Matching works with your skills, but', 'Profil ini berstatus {status} dengan {count} {answerLabel} wajib yang belum dijawab ({fields}). Pemadanan menggunakan kemahiran anda, tetapi', '此个人档案为{status}状态，仍缺少 {count} 项必填{answerLabel}（{fields}）。匹配仍使用您的技能，但'],
  'This module is not built yet. Nothing on this page is a working feature or a result.': ['This module is not built yet. Nothing on this page is a working feature or a result.', 'Modul ini belum dibangunkan. Tiada ciri atau hasil yang berfungsi pada halaman ini.', '此模块尚未开发。此页面上没有可用功能或结果。'],
  'This part of the app hit an error. The rest of the app is still running.': ['This part of the app hit an error. The rest of the app is still running.', 'Bahagian aplikasi ini mengalami ralat. Bahagian lain masih berfungsi.', '应用的此部分发生错误，其余部分仍可运行。'],
  'Three distinct lenses on work: official labour-force measures, a finite snapshot of supplied job records, and dated workforce research.': ['Three distinct lenses on work: official labour-force measures, a finite snapshot of supplied job records, and dated workforce research.', 'Tiga sudut pandang berbeza tentang pekerjaan: ukuran rasmi tenaga buruh, petikan terhad rekod pekerjaan yang dibekalkan, dan penyelidikan tenaga kerja bertarikh.', '从三个不同角度观察就业：官方劳动力指标、有限的职位记录快照，以及有日期的劳动力研究。'],
