  'Try another missing skill, provider, or access status. A catalogue search is not a verified course.': ['Try another missing skill, provider, or access status. A catalogue search is not a verified course.', 'Cuba kemahiran yang belum dipadankan, penyedia atau status akses lain. Carian katalog bukan kursus yang disahkan.', '请尝试其他未匹配技能、提供方或访问状态。目录搜索结果不代表已核实课程。'],
  'Unemployed-person values remain above; only available observations are plotted, with no gaps filled.': ['Unemployed-person values remain above; only available observations are plotted, with no gaps filled.', 'Nilai bilangan penganggur kekal di atas; hanya pemerhatian tersedia diplot dan tiada jurang diisi.', '失业人数仍显示在上方；图表仅绘制现有观测值，不填补缺失数据。'],
