  '{count} hours available per week, as saved in your profile. This is context only; no course completion timeline is estimated.': ['{count} hours available per week, as saved in your profile. This is context only; no course completion timeline is estimated.', '{count} jam seminggu tersedia seperti yang disimpan dalam profil anda. Ini hanya konteks; tiada anggaran tempoh menamatkan kursus dibuat.', '您的个人档案中记录每周可用 {count} 小时。这仅作背景参考，不估算课程完成时间。'],
