  "Known prerequisites are placed first. Other skills remain in the order used by the job record. This is a suggested sequence, not an employer-provided learning plan.": ["Known prerequisites are placed first. Other skills remain in the order used by the job record. This is a suggested sequence, not an employer-provided learning plan.", "Prasyarat yang diketahui diletakkan dahulu. Kemahiran lain kekal mengikut susunan dalam rekod kerja. Ini ialah urutan yang dicadangkan, bukan pelan pembelajaran daripada majikan.", "已知的先修要求排在前面。其他技能保持职位记录中的顺序。这是建议的学习顺序，并非雇主提供的学习计划。"],
  "These are rough planning estimates for a first guided practice only (technical skills: 8–16 study hours; soft skills: 3–8 practice hours). They are not course durations or guarantees of proficiency or job readiness.": ["These are rough planning estimates for a first guided practice only (technical skills: 8–16 study hours; soft skills: 3–8 practice hours). They are not course durations or guarantees of proficiency or job readiness.", "Ini anggaran perancangan kasar untuk latihan berpandu pertama sahaja (kemahiran teknikal: 8–16 jam belajar; kemahiran insaniah: 3–8 jam latihan). Ini bukan tempoh kursus atau jaminan penguasaan mahupun kesediaan bekerja.", "这些仅是首次指导练习的粗略规划估算（技术技能：8–16 小时学习；软技能：3–8 小时练习）。这不是课程时长，也不保证熟练程度或就业准备度。"],
